# Copy to .env.local for development. Never commit real values (see AGENTS.md, ADR-0005, ADR-0004).
# None of these are wired up yet — S-01 only documents where they'll live; S-02/S-03/later stories make them functional.

# Supabase (S-02) — server-side only, never exposed to the client bundle.
